    "arity_context": "Store-aware arities 0/1/3 and context-free arities 0/1/3 assert exact HelperArityMismatch. Correctly tagged context-free handles assert exact context-required TypeMismatch. No handle-validity assertion on context-free API.",
    "hot_errors": "Seven direct eval_has tests assert exact EngineError variants/payloads for tags, invalid handles, and distinguishable ordering; four positives use actual eval_expr_with_store via valid compiled program.",
    "replay_errors": "Six tests call public replay::ops::eval_replay_op with initialized stack, valid two-node plan, and actual RunFrame PC1; assert exact ExpressionEvalFailed step1. Test success cannot arise from invalid plan/step setup; Has dispatch actually consumes supplied operands. Both-wrong tests do not reveal internal precedence because public error is shared.",
    "mutation_reasoning": [
      "Constant true/false or list-membership restoration fails literal positive/negative object fixtures.",
      "Removing Symbol resolution returns false for invalid Symbol on a valid empty object; store and hot exact-error tests fail; replay exact Err also fails.",
      "Swapping type/handle validation order fails distinguishable store/hot combined-fault cases.",
      "Mapping replay errors to StepIdx::ZERO instead of actual PC fails every new replay negative.",
      "Wrong arity or replacing context-required error with success/wrong payload fails direct whole-Result equality."
    ]
  },
